:: StoryTitle
An Example Story

:: Start
# Hello, world!

This is *the start* of [[your adventure]].
[[Non-existent Link]]

:: Your Adventure
You are at **a fork in the road**. Do you take the [[right path->Certain Doom]]
or the [[Happy Ever After<-left path]]?

Would you like [[a hint|The Oracle]]?

:: Certain Doom
You are attacked by a *band of bandits*. You fight hard and bravely, but in the end **you are killed**.

[[Restart->Start]]

:: Happy Ever After
You are attacked by *wild dogs*! Before they have a chance to do too much damage
to you, however, a gunshot scares them off. You look upon your rescuer,
who is the most beautiful person you've ever met.

Six months later, you are married to the person who saved your life, and you
live **happily ever after**. 

**[[The End->Start]]**

:: The Oracle
You seek advice from **The Oracle**. She tells you: 

```
* "The right path will lead to `certain doom`."
* "The left path will lead to your `happy ever after`."
```

[[Return->Your Adventure]]
